AI Workflow Architect
Day 42/60 — #60DaysOfClaudeAI
A single-file HTML app that generates a complete, execution-ready AI workflow for any business process — instead of generic advice or a checklist.
What it does
Answer a few guided questions (industry → specific role/process → structure preference), and the app maps out a full end-to-end workflow broken into logical stages, each with:
Objectives & tasks
Best AI tools for that stage (with reasoning + alternatives)
Ready-to-use prompt examples
Best practices & common mistakes
Expected outputs & time estimates
Efficiency tips
Demo build: Product Brand Launch
This instance maps Marketing → Brand Strategy → Product Brand Launch (Physical/Consumer Product) across 8 stages — from market validation to post-launch scaling — with 30+ AI tools mapped, a decision tree, tool comparison table, interactive diagram, and a recommended AI stack.
Features
8-stage interactive workflow with expandable sections
Task checklists with progress tracking (saved locally)
Bookmarking / starring key stages
Per-stage notes (autosaved)
Decision tree for path-specific recommendations
Tool comparison table
Printable/exportable view
Fully responsive, dark-mode UI
Tech
Pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. Zero external libraries or frameworks. Zero dependencies, zero CDN calls — fully self-contained in one file.
